    <section>
        <h2>1. Spicy Miso Ramen</h2>  
        <img src="images/spicy-miso-ramen.jpg" alt="spicy miso ramen" width="500">
        <p>This is a delicious and hearty ramen recipe that combines the rich flavors of miso with a spicy kick. Perfect for a cozy night in!</p>
        <h3>Ingredients:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>4 cups of vegetable broth</li>
            <li>2 tablespoons of miso paste</li>
            <li>1 tablespoon of soy sauce</li>
            <li>1 teaspoon of sesame oil</li>
            <li>2 cloves of garlic, minced</li>
            <li>1 teaspoon of ginger, grated</li>
            <li>1 pack of ramen noodles</li>
            <li>1 cup of sliced mushrooms</li>  
            <li>1 cup of chopped bok choy</li>
            <li>1/2 cup of corn kernels</li>
            <li>1/2 teaspoon of red pepper flakes (adjust to taste)</li>
            <li>Chopped green onions for garnish</li>
        </ul>   
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2> 2. Veggie Kebabs</h2>
        <img src="images/veggie-kebabs.jpg" alt="veggie kebabs" width="500">
        <p>These colorful veggie kebabs are perfect for grilling season! They are packed with flavor and can be served as a main dish or a side.</p>    
        <h3>Ingredients:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>1 red bell pepper, cut into chunks</li>
            <li>1 yellow bell pepper, cut into chunks</li>
            <li>1 zucchini, sliced into rounds</li>  
            <li>1 red onion, cut into chunks</li>
            <li>1 cup of cherry tomatoes</li>
            <li>1/4 cup of olive oil</li>
            <li>2 tablespoons of balsamic vinegar</li>
            <li>1 teaspoon of dried oregano</li>
            <li>Salt and pepper to taste</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>3. Vegan Vanilla Ice Cream</h2>
        <img src="images/vegan-vanilla-ice-cream.jpg" alt="vegan vanilla ice cream" width="500">
        <p>This creamy and delicious vegan vanilla ice cream is made with coconut milk and is perfect for a sweet treat on a hot day!</p>
        <h3>Ingredients:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>2 cans of full-fat coconut milk</li>
            <li>3/4 cup of sugar</li>
            <li>1 tablespoon of vanilla extract</li>
            <li>Pinch of salt</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
